<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal">Dear {!Contact.FirstName},<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><br></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">We are very pleased to have you as a National Funding customer,
and we hope the feeling is mutual. You should have received an email recently
from trustpilot.com asking you to rate and review your recent experience with
National Funding. Thank you very much for leaving your feedback on Trustpilot
if you have already done so; we greatly appreciate it.<o:p></o:p></p><p class="MsoNormal"><br></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">If you haven’t already left a review, we would greatly
appreciate you sharing your feedback though this 1-minute survey on
Trustpilot’s website: <a href="https://www.trustpilot.com/evaluate/nationalfunding.com">https://www.trustpilot.com/evaluate/nationalfunding.com</a>.<o:p></o:p></p>

<p class="MsoNormal">Thank you again for financing your business with National
Funding, we look forward to helping you again with any future business financing
needs.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>]]></td>
